              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Idaho4now"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Quite tasty, however it tasted like really a really oily egg and ham rice ensemble. Next time I will cut the oil in half; and add more soy sauce for a more Asian than breakfast taste. I also HALVED the salt and it was plenty along with the soy sauce.",
