              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GrannyKandy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Cut oil in half &amp; 1/4 c. chicken broth to keep egg moist; used only 1/2 t. salt since ham and soy sauce has so much sodium. Otherwise followed directions. Very good!",
            "datePublished": "2013-12-03T07:28:28.377Z"
